  "title": "L3Harris Closes $1B Investment from Department of War in Missile Solutions Business",
  "summary": "L3Harris Technologies has closed a $1 billion strategic investment from the Department of War in its Missile Solutions business, which it will use to expand and modernize facilities, accelerate research and development, and increase production capacity for critical national security technologies.",
